  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Technical expertise to support on specific activities both the implementing partners and the EU Delegation, and to ensure the ownership of the Ministry of Health (MoH) II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Service Contract will provide targeted technical assistance to support the implementation of Outputs 1, 2, and 4 of ACT-1114 (PIMI III). The assignment will focus on strengthening technical coordination, knowledge management, and policy dialogue in the area of maternal and child health.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In particular, the contractor will support the dissemination and operationalisation of an existing note of good practice, including adapting it for relevant stakeholders. The contract will also cover the design and establishment of a digital archive on maternal and child health for the Ministry of Health, ensuring structured access, sustainability, and institutional ownership.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Furthermore, the contractor will conceptualise and develop the working methodology for a newly established technical working group, including providing guidance on its functioning and orientation. This includes supporting the creation and framing of a dedicated sub-group focused on gratuity and free access to services, ensuring coherence with national priorities and ongoing reforms.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
